# Acrobatic Cheerleader, Survival: "At the beginning of your second main phase, if this creature is tapped, put a flying counter on
# it. This ability triggers only once." Delney, Streetwise Lookout would have a 2-power creature's ability trigger an additional
# time, but "if an effect would cause Acrobatic Cheerleader's ability to trigger again, that part of the effect won't do anything"
# (its ruling): the Cheerleader, tapped by its attack on turn 3, triggers once, with one ability on the stack, not two.

